    <preface>
      <p>Transport Security Legislation Amendment Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 18, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to amend legislation relating to transport security, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Aviation Transport Security Act 2004	3</p>
