      <p>Transport Security Legislation Amendment Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 18, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to amend legislation relating to transport security, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 28 March 2017</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Transport Securit</i><i>y Legislation Amendment Act 2017</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>28 March 2017</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Aviation Transport Security Act 2004</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 35(2)(f), 36(2)(f) and 36A(2)(f)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “for entry to”, insert “, or that are in,”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Subsection 41(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit all the words after “made under”, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><ref href="#sec-44">section 44</ref>:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in preparation for boarding an aircraft; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in order to enter or remain in an area or zone within a security controlled airport.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Subparagraph 41A(1)(b)(ii)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “enter”, insert “or remain in”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Subsection 42(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit all the words after “made under”, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><ref href="#sec-44">section 44</ref>:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in preparation for being taken on board an aircraft; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in order to be taken into or remain in an area or zone within a security controlled airport.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Subsection 43(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit all the words after “made under”, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><ref href="#sec-44">section 44</ref>:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in preparation for being taken on board an aircraft; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in order to enter or remain in an area or zone within a security controlled airport.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsection 44(3)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “(2)(aa)”, insert “, (2)(i)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Subsection 127(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “who holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 2, or equivalent, position”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2">
            <heading>Maritime Transport and Offshore Facilities Security Act 2003</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Subsection 202(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “who holds, or is acting in, an Executive Level 2, or equivalent, position”.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 1 December 2016</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 13 February 2017</i>]</p>
                <p>(188/16)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
